      <description>Scratchd is a notes app for Mac, iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch. Every note is a plain file in your own iCloud Drive, with no account and nothing tracked. It arrives at version 10; the first nine were used every day and never sold. Coming to the App Store at $4.99 per platform, or $8.99 for both, bought once.</description>
